{{en-verb}}

# To [[cook]] food on a [[grill]]; to [[barbecue]].
#: ''Why don't we get together Saturday and '''grill''' some burgers?''
# {{context|Australian|NZ|UK|lang=en}} To cook food under the [[element]] of a [[stove]] or only under the top element of an [[oven]] - {{context|US|lang=en}} [[broil]].
# {{context|colloquial|lang=en}} To [[interrogate]]; to [[question]] [[aggressively]] or [[harshly]].
#: ''The [[police]] '''grilled''' him about his movements at the time of the [[crime]].''

